<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line" lang="en">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">FLUX-Reason-6M &amp; PRISM-Bench: A Million-Scale Text-to-Image Reasoning Dataset and Comprehensive Benchmark</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Rongyao Fang*
</span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
